/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114040553","verified_at":"2026-10-24T21:50:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4316030-1846018067934322","game_id":"steam-4316030","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.5.0 Is Now Available!","summary":"Hello, Heroes!A new update for Age of Failon – Birth of the Hero is here!Version 0.5.0 focuses on improving the user interface, introducing a new tooltip system, redesigning mouse cursors, and fixing several issues.What's New & ImprovedCompletely Redesigned Cursors – All mouse cursors have received a visual overhaul, making different actions easier to recognize.Improved Cursor Behavior – Fixed incorrect cursor states, including the disabled cursor appearing over interface elements.Smarter Spell ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T18:23:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934322","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4316030-1844115010495216","game_id":"steam-4316030","kind":"update","title":"Age of Failon – Demo Update v0.4.0","summary":"Demo v0.4.0 is now available!This update brings a new main menu, a completely redesigned unit recruitment experience, a new Game Controls overview, improvements to Army Storage, a full rework of the campaign maps, and several important fixes.A New Main MenuThe main menu has received a complete visual rework with brand-new background artwork and an updated Age of Failon – Birth of the Hero logo.The new design brings Failon and Gudin directly into the main menu while introducing a darker fantasy a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T15:30:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010495216","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4316030-1843481262705317","game_id":"steam-4316030","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.3.0 – Progression, Maps & Save System","summary":"Age of Failon Demo – Update 0.3.0This update brings major improvements to map generation, progression, movement controls, battle behavior, save handling, and overall stability.Several systems were also reworked internally to make future development and map creation more reliable.Gameplay & ProgressionThe first 4 Castle buildings are now automatically built at the start of the game.Total Building Points have been adjusted from 950 to 946 to reflect the new starting buildings.Rebalanced Spell Card","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T18:15:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262705317","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4316030-1842846814453723","game_id":"steam-4316030","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.2.0 — Bug Fixes & Battle AI Improvements","summary":"Age of Failon Demo — Update 0.2.0The first update for the Age of Failon demo is now available!This update focuses mainly on bug fixes and improvements discovered during testing after the demo release.FixedFixed a crash that could occur when saving settings from the Lobby.Fixed defeated enemy heroes potentially reappearing after restarting the game.Fixed enemy heroes sometimes generating identical armies across multiple objectives on the same map.Fixed a battle turn-order issue where the next uni","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T17:49:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814453723","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4316030-1842212951303552","game_id":"steam-4316030","kind":"update","title":"Age of Failon – A Major Development Update","summary":"It has been a while since the last update here on Steam, but development of Age of Failon: Birth of the Hero certainly hasn’t stopped.Quite the opposite.Over the past months, the game has gone through some of the largest changes since development began. Several core systems have been rebuilt, the visual direction has changed significantly, and Age of Failon is now much closer to the game I originally wanted to create.With the next stage of development approaching, this is a good time to look at ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T15:18:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951303552","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4316030-1825093633188737","game_id":"steam-4316030","kind":"announcement","title":"Visual Evolution: The New Dark Fantasy UI is Here!","summary":"Greetings, Heroes!We’ve been working tirelessly behind the scenes to make the world of Age of Failon: Birth of the Hero more immersive, atmospheric, and polished. Today, we are excited to reveal a massive rework of our User Interface!Our goal was to move away from the basic, grounded aesthetic and embrace a true Dark Fantasy vibe. We’ve introduced custom-forged iron textures, mystical violet glows, and a completely new layout for our core screens.Check out the transformation below:⚔️ Main Menu O","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-20T18:28:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825093633188737","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4316030":{"